  "sn18.8:1.2": "Taṃ kim maññasi Rāhula || || ",
  "sn18.8:1.3": "Rūpataṇhā niccā vā aniccā vāti || || ",
  "sn18.8:1.4": "Aniccā bhante || || 3-7 ",
  "sn18.8:1.5": "Saddataṇhā || ",
  "sn18.8:1.6": "Gandhataṇhā || ",
  "sn18.8:1.7": "Rasataṇhā || ",
  "sn18.8:1.8": "Poṭṭhabbataṇha || ",
  "sn18.8:1.9": "Dhammataṇhā ṇiccā vā aniccā vāti || || ",
  "sn18.8:1.10": "Aniccā bhante || || 8-9 ",
  "sn18.8:1.11": "Evam passaṃ Rāhula sutavā ariyasāvako rūpataṇhāya pi nibbindati || saddataṇhāya pi || gandhataṇhāya pi || rasataṇhāya pi || phoṭṭhabbataṇhāya pi || dhammataṇhāya pi nibbindati || pe|| ",
  "sn18.8:1.12": "pajānātīti || || ",
  "sn18.8:1.13": "Aṭṭhamaṃ || || 1 Sāvatthi || || 2 "
